7317.2s 123 The paper used its own data; our numbers are on the 498R All-in-One test split (different data),
7317.2s 124 so the comparison shows the direction and size of the gap, not a head-to-head result.
7317.2s 125 
7317.2s 126 The paper scores image quality (PSNR / SSIM against a well-lit photo of the same scene) on LOL; we have no well-lit twin of our night photos, so we score what we care about: plates found and plates read.
